@program gtk3-text-input-test
@compositor kwin
@conf hime-edit-display=2
@conf hime-on-the-spot-key=1
# As wl-im-switch.keys, with KWin's input-method-v1:
# Tab moves to the next field (deactivate, activate): the keys typed into
# the first one are dropped with its preedit, and the second field types
# afresh.
--two a <space> b c @check <tab> @check a <space> @check
